      "writtenOn": "2024-12-06T20:42:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The trouble is proxy_deactivate() may have called proxy_resched_idle(rq), so we might have idle now setup to be the next task, even if proxy_deactivate() failed. So instead we set it RUNNABLE and return NULL forcing pick_next_task to be run again which hopefully will pick the now unblocked donor.\n\nBut you raise a good issue, that proxy_deactivate() having side-effects in its failure case is not ideal and makes this more subtle.  I\u0027ll see if I can rework this better in v15.",
